Climo increased Ayr's lead after a kick from the penalty shootout just before the end of the first half. He scored the touchdown first, and later he seized a chance of an increase, getting a score of 17:5 for Ayr.
Melrose started the second half well. Patrick Anderson's tapping elevated by Baggot reduced the loss to five points.
Then there was a longer halt to the game due to Ruaridh Knott’s serious injury. The player was lifted off the pitch on a stretcher. After the resumption, Ayr increased the lead after Stafford McDowall’s touchdown and Clim’s elevation.
