Still Game's star begins career in the catering industry
Ford Kieran, the star of the series Still Game, seems to have started in the catering industry. It has recently been discovered that he has become the director of the restaurant management company.
The 56-year-old actor takes on the role of Jack Jarvis on the BBC's popular sitcom. He performs and co-creates the series together with his longtime comedy partner Greg Hemphill.
The duo announced that the upcoming ninth season will be the last in the history of the series. All indications are that Ford Kiernan is already planning the future after leaving “Craiglang”.
According to official data, he became the director of Adriftmorn Limited.
