Elite League: Dundee Stars — Belfast Giants 5:3
In the match against Dundee, Patrick Dwyer scored two goals for the Giants team
Dundee Stars have atoned for Friday's Elite League defeat to the Belfast Giants, winning Saturday's rematch match at home 5:3.
