When the data confirmed that Quinton was about to stay with his friend Michael Sanford, his mobile phone was at Jessica Chambers, police decided to question Sanford.
On Saturday, Sanford testified that he wasn't in town that day.
When asked by prosecutors whether Tellis was telling the truth, claiming he was in Sanford’s truck that night, he replied that “he was lying because my truck was in Nashville at the time.”
Another inaccuracy is Tellis' claim he's known Chambers for about two weeks.
Mobile phone records have shown that they had only known each other for a week.
Rowlett said some time after Chambers Tellis had removed her contact information from her phone, as well as texts and calls.
